{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a947cdc5-b4ed-8b7e-bbd5-181a831f9d87",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T13:23:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. Sorry, hang on, I've got a bunch of bags here. [pause] Okay. I'm calling about a fence. I got a quote from a fence company and I want to check on things before I sign anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:20:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's smart to check first. Is the fence for your own property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's for my parents' house, I'm doing the paperwork for them. It's twelve Mill Street, up on the Hill. My name is Dulce Semedo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Dulce, thanks. And what kind of fence are they looking at? Material, height, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Composite. Not wood, the, um, the plastic wood kind. And it's about four and a half feet tall. So do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here, and in the Historic Hill area there may be an extra review on top of that. Is the fence going along the front, or around the back and sides?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the back and down one side. Not the front, I don't think. Hold on, let me look at the quote. [pause] Sorry, the, um, where did I, okay. Back and the left side, it says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Does the fence company say they'll handle the permit application, or is that left to the homeowner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It doesn't say. It just has the price and the, the footage. I can ask him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd ask him that before you sign, and put it in writing on the contract. Either way, the permit has to be in place before any work begins. You'd want a simple sketch of where the fence goes on the lot, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:22:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sketch. Got it. Oh, and one more thing. Does the finished side have to face out? Like toward the neighbors, or the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a common rule, the finished side facing outward, but I don't want you to assume. When you apply, the reviewer will confirm it for your lot. Is the left side next to a neighbor's yard, or a street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A neighbor. Just the neighbor. Sorry, one second. [pause] My parents are coming for dinner and I have to leave soon, so I'm trying to do everything at once here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we can wrap up. Here's what I'd do. Get the contractor to confirm in writing who pulls the permit, and have the sketch ready. You can stop by our office or call back and we'll walk you through the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the permit comes before he starts, not after, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, before. Don't let him put in a single post until you have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's what I needed. Thank you, Anita."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy your dinner, and call back if you have questions on the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
